{"body":{"text":["Glass is three notions meeting: ontology, pure functional compute, and language models. Inference chooses, pure compute acts, and both work on one ontology: a field's shape lets a program compute over a holon, and its prose lets a model understand the same holon, so a model can choose and compose programs by what they mean, and the programs then run with no inference in them at all."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G00011CW","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["What it serves is giving and receiving. Good compute, technology, interfaces and connections go both ways: from the person using it, to the group, to the greater whole."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G00011F2","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The three notions and both ways the author's, ",{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G00011GC"},"; inference choosing and pure compute acting on one ontology the session's words, which the author took as his.*"]},"id":"1M6YBY3G00011G1","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"leads":{"$ref":"1M6YBY3G0000VF3"},"text":["2026-11-02"]},"id":"1M6YBY3G00011GC","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000014"]}
{"body":{"text":["Everything in glass stands on a few primitives, so they come next."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G00011H1","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Data, types, programs, AI and interfaces are one field of whole pieces, and everything else in glass grows on them. Here they are in the order they stand on each other: the holon, its type, the store that keeps it, the engine that holds the stores, the field they make, the program, its effect, AI, and the interface. They are few on purpose: the author's aim is a core set of primitives, done with quality."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G00011HG","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
