{"body":{"text":["The author saw that the root was still a custom component, and that nothing in glass could move: the primitives hold no state, take no press and go nowhere, so looking around had to be built on them. The session proposed a Reading holon, then actions as holons, then a layout whose mounts follow presses, and the author found each made up or convoluted, and asked that it look wide, at glass and at OpenLight, and say what is pure and what is not. It read OpenLight's view and components itself, after stopping an agent the author did not trust to carry it, and named what was convoluted, most of it its own: components that navigated, a location with four shapes, the field's own component, chrome wired into the interface, and a form of expression no one could read."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G0001S6S","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["What was left is small. The root is one mount in the home, a component and its argument, and every move is a new version of it, so its versions are the history. The reader is a component made of data, a template of two mounts giving `$`. Expressions given in an argument are holons. A press rises from where it landed, past the locations slots carry, to the mount that may be written, and its menu offers what takes the place pressed, found by type. Let go with it: the layout and the arrangement, the Field component, `held` and `under`, the slot's chrome, and every way a component placed the reader."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G0001SB8","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Two fresh readings followed. The first found the entry could be written twice, cutting the reader's history, and the field's projection still in the engine; the second, that a component chosen from the menu stuck to every press after it, and that presses queued behind the first move could make a second root. All were mended."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G0001SF1","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Then the author asked to see where he is: a face of what is looked at says too little. The mount now says its own location above what it gives, in words, and opens it to be changed where it stands, to a way of looking the field holds, a holon by its name, or an expression written there and born in the home. Writing one brought the first holon a component makes, so a write became one act with what it brings into being, in one commit."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G0001SGX","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The author found that line rudimentary, presets and raw text, and asked what is needed at the core. Reasoned together: a holon has a few axes everywhere, what it is, how it connects, where it enters; a gathered set is flat; expressions are grouping, in layers, each collection a way of looking opened in turn; and with nothing chosen, everything grouped by what splits it best. Built as play: new forms for everything, what a holon points at and a store, a grouping whose collections are expressions, and a measure of strength that favours a few groups over many and over two; the root gives Everything, grouped so. The top bar became the way walked, each step and each axis a place to press, and the presets and the raw box were let go. Each layer visited is born in the home as a way of looking, which is a cost still to weigh."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G0001SKS","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
