{"body":{"text":["The author named glass as three notions meeting, ontology, pure functional compute and language models, and took the session's words for how they join: inference chooses, pure compute acts, both on one ontology. What it serves, he said, is giving and receiving, both ways, from the person to the greater whole."]},"id":"1M6YBY3G0001W8Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
