{"body":{"text":["- **The site built on glass**: this project's own site, a module of its repository, with the author's website and CV depending on it, from one unit of open data. It is not begun."]},"id":"1M7585EX7H7G2QV","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The engine as its own artefact, with one protocol as its only contract. The chassis that hosts and decides nothing. The interface that holds no lasting state, with components declaring what they take and mounts as calls. The home as a store, with what it attaches and the entry it boots into. Programs and places in place of chrome. The reader component as what is wanted. The attach record: writing declared when a store is attached, and commits sent to the store that holds what they change. A module as a store, its store beside its code."]},"id":"1M7585EX7H7G2WJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
