{"body":{"text":["On 2026-11-10 a set was told apart from a list at commit, and a pattern's step came to be asked once for all its bindings, a store's level falling from 466 to 155 ms; the field as arrays, the session's first purpose, was attacked and let go."]},"id":"1M7585EX7H7G3EJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Holding the primitives, the architecture says where they are kept and how they move: a store anyone can serve as plain files, and a client that pulls it and runs an engine over it, with a store of the reader's own."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX01A","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A store is reached through an integration: glass's own store is the native one, and a git repository, the browser's history or a video's data are reached the same way, each by an integration of its own."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX02H","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Glass's own store is how glass keeps a field and how it travels: plain files, nearly all of which never change, and one pointer that moves. Because nothing in it is ever rewritten, any copy of a store, anywhere, is whole and can check itself, and every state it ever had is still in it."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX04B","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Glass's own store, told before this, is read by one integration among others: the one the engine speaks natively."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX050","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Each varies without the others. Two people may read one repository as two fields: one its files, the other its history as events. One shape may be given from many sources, and several integrations may give the same shape. An integration declares the shape it gives and what it takes, each with its prose and shape. So the engine finds one for a store by its shape and its origin, as the interface finds a component by the type it takes."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX0GT","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The author spoke of a memory integration beside glass's own. The session's reading, that memory is only one more place glass's files are kept, as a folder, a host and the browser are, is not his. That glass's own shape is open, and that ids stay the same from read to read, are the session's.*"]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX0NS","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The author's, 2026-11-10 and 2026-11-11: dependencies, it is honest, for you place it there because you need it for completeness, though they can be cyclic; origin is fine, and it is really just metadata, so it may stay in the field; if something's external and you remove it, it's broken, you don't see what it was, you just have an empty id, and I never liked that. A dedicated structure at the store's root, not its dependencies placed blindly among what it holds, his own; its fields and their names reasoned with the session the same night.*"]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX0RX","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The author's, 2026-11-10 and 2026-11-11: if I'm doing an action that goes over multiple stores in one commit, I prefer that to be the same commit; maybe commits have two SHAs really, one over its history, one over its content, because sometimes you take a thing away and bring it back; I dislike the name parent here, it makes me think of holarchy, rather predecessor; a holon must always have a residence, the root store or a holon somewhere below, or of course mounted in several. That the store is not part of the commit history he said and doubted at once, something about that doesn't resonate, and settled only through a holon's residence and the line holding the act. The line's own marks, the order of landing, an interrupted act finished, ids minted together and the old lines kept as they are the session's, which first set the act across stores aside until he said it was central to the plan.*"]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX12J","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The clause is the contract between the engine and a store's integration: one fact asked, any of its places known, answered with what matches and how many there are. Planning, joining, not, or and tests are the engine's."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX13V","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["For a store that only gives its holons, as glass's own does, the engine builds the index itself: the same facts kept by holon, by holon and key, by key, by key and value, and by what a value refers to. It is built where it runs, and for now never shipped; shipping it would ask that holding be read from `$holds` alone, since a mould may stand in another store. A source too large or too foreign to read whole may have its integration answer clauses itself, from an index or a language of its own."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX170","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*This revises the seventh session's paths, that indexing is neither the engine's nor coupled to it and that a store's index may be shipped beside it: the engine builds the index for a store that only gives holons, a store's integration may answer for itself, and the index is not shipped while it costs what reading the store does. The author took the mix on 2026-11-10; not shipping is the session's judgement from the measure. Triple Pattern Fragments drew the same line between a source and its client.*"]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX19W","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
