{"body":{"text":["The lexicon, today a holon holding every word as one lexeme, its text in lower case, is to become a pure function over the field's strings, settled on 2026-11-10: a word's lexeme is its text normalised, worked out when asked, so the lexeme holons are let go, while the words stay holons, for fidelity. A Term is the deliberate thing: a holon made on purpose where a word matters, so each has a page of its own. Neither is built."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX1V3","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A session reads into the field before it works, works in steps it keeps whole, and leaves what it found in the field before it ends. Nothing it knows lives anywhere else: memory is off, and no session starts on local changes."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX1WH","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A session is kept whole in the author's words: every utterance as it came, typed or spoken, the dictation's mishearings corrected on the word. After each stands the essence of the session's answer. Its paths are what it noted for what comes next, The plan from here among them, each standing noted or let go."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX1ZR","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
