{"body":{"text":["The wiki is rewritten under ",{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M758EV0R3YX20Y"}," in rounds. The whole is written, then read by fresh agents: one holding only the rule and the draft, one checking it against the sessions, one looking for what was lost. What they find is mended, and the whole read again, until a round changes only words. A brief that holds is kept, and old prose stays in each brief's history."]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX230","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The author's, 2026-11-11: updating the wiki is not a one shot, it is iterative as the rule explores; verify that the knowledge from the session is transferred, that the prose is under the rule, and that nothing in the wiki is lost; verify against the sessions for alignment; so a new session has a tended wiki that holds the process around it, the best companion for sessions to come. The bootstrap, the keeping of sessions, measures and threads the author's over earlier sessions, memory off his of 2026-11-06, gathered here by the session.*"]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX26Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
