{"body":{"text":["*Settled since, 2026-11-10 and 2026-11-11: how a commit says what it touched across stores, by one act, one commit. The questions opened the same days the session's, from the author's words.*"]},"id":"1M758EV0R3YX2CN","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The `write` field the author's, in the attachment he said to stick with, 2026-11-11. That writing is granted there alone, never by a store, and that a dependency attached reads only, are the session's.*"]},"id":"1M758P91PN6H014","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
