{"body":{"text":["**How a store taken away is born**: copied whole, or born from the table of the store it leaves, as ",{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M75MBJC3E6H2VG"}," leaves it. The cuts of the plan's fourth step wait on the author's word."]},"id":"1M75MBJC3E6H2W1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Where threads live**: with the author's words in the author's store, or with the wiki in main as the field's own questions, now that any voice raises them. It waits on the author."]},"id":"1M75MBJC3E6H2X7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
